# Veridify frontend — environment template
#
# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) and edit.
#
# RECOMMENDED — route the API through Next.js (no CORS, works in dev + prod):
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=/api/proxy
#   API_PROXY_TARGET=https://veridify-ai.onrender.com
#
# DIRECT — talk to the backend straight from the browser. Backend must
# allow this origin in its ALLOWED_ORIGINS env var:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://veridify-ai.onrender.com
#
# MOCK — clear both variables (or remove this file) to use lib/mock-data.ts.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=/api/proxy
API_PROXY_TARGET=https://veridify-ai.onrender.com
